# Castle Embereth: "{1}{R}{R}, {T}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn." (CR 611.2c.)
# Turn 5, Castle untapped beside the Mountain: with Island, Mountain and Mox Jet tapped ({U}{R}{B}: three mana, but one
# {R}) the ability is not offered - the second {R} is pinned. On turn 7 Mountain, Mox Ruby and Mox Jet pay {1}{R}{R}
# exactly: the pool is empty and the Castle tapped. Bot1's 0/2 Ornithopter becomes 1/2 (+1/+0, toughness unchanged),
# Bot2's stays 0/2 ("you control"), an Ornithopter cast afterwards stays 0/2 (only creatures there as it resolved), and
# on turn 9 the first one is 0/2 again (until end of turn).

